   "lines": [
    "There was a south",
    "easter blowing, with",
    "continual heavy",
    "rain squalls. I went",
    "out sailing for",
    "ducks but after",
    "getting drenched",
    "through returned",
    "with nothing. I",
    "missed a good shot",
    "at a grebe."
